<title>CANADA: Toronto bond traders recommend early close.</title>
<headline>Toronto bond traders recommend early close.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Toronto Bond Traders' Association on Friday said it was recommending an early close for the market ahead of the Victoria Day long weekend.</p>
<p>The association is recommending that the market cease trading at 1200 EDT/1600 GMT.</p>
<p>The move effectively means an early close to bond market across Canada, as most bond traders are located in Toronto.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
